  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2016/12/IMG_1341.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>(14 fotos) La Joyer&iacute;a-Relojer&iacute;a Santolaria, en la calle San Miguel, 11 de Onda cerrar&aacute; sus puertas a finales de enero y liquida todas sus existencias con descuentos de un 20, 30 o 50%. El horario actual de apertura al p&uacute;blico es s&oacute;lo por las ma&ntilde;anas.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/joieriasantolariatanca/img_1337.jpg\" alt=\"img_1337\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/joieriasantolariatanca/img_1340.jpg\" alt=\"img_1340\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/joieriasantolariatanca/img_1341.jpg\" alt=\"img_1341\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/joieriasantolariatanca/img_1343.jpg\" alt=\"img_1343\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/joieriasantolariatanca/img_1346.jpg\" alt=\"img_1346\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/joieriasantolariatanca/img_1348.jpg\" alt=\"img_1348\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/joieriasantolariatanca/img_1351.jpg\" alt=\"img_1351\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/joieriasantolariatanca/img_1352.jpg\" alt=\"img_1352\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/joieriasantolariatanca/img_1355.jpg\" alt=\"img_1355\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25d